  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Fill 1/3 of a cocktail shaker with ice. Shake bitters over ice and pour in bourbon. Pour orange-flavored liqueur and maraschino cherry juice into shaker. Cover shaker and shake vigorously. Pour drink into a martini glass and garnish with maraschino cherry.",
